{"id":"469553","name":"冬瓜海带汤","author":"柠檬小厨～～","authorId":"10838527","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/469553/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"海带","amount":"150g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"冬瓜去皮。","img":"images/469553/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净，切薄片。","img":"images/469553/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"海带切宽条。","img":"images/469553/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅，油热，下葱白煸香，下入冬瓜翻炒。","img":"images/469553/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"下入海带一起翻炒，烹料酒。","img":"images/469553/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入开水煮，调味，加盐，鸡精，煮至冬瓜软海带糯即可。","img":"images/469553/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"成品！","img":"images/469553/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}